# TIN TROOP 4-B, the Jack of the Chest, with plain button presses
# (recorded once from a route plan). The first soldier marches out of the
# door, climbs to the ledge and lances the carved eagle's eye on the chest:
# the Jack springs up with his mouth open. The second walks through the
# candle on the ledge and, burning, lances straight down his throat.
game tintroop
wait 5
cheat unlock
press A
wait 5
press A
wait 30
press A
wait 5
wait 24
hold RIGHT 24
hold RIGHT+A 16
wait 5
hold RIGHT+A 16
wait 6
hold RIGHT 37
hold A 4
hold A+B 2
wait 104
hold RIGHT 24
hold RIGHT+A 16
wait 5
hold RIGHT+A 16
wait 6
hold RIGHT 37
hold A 5
hold A+B 2
wait 1
wait 200
expect boss_dead == 1
expect state == 4
expect best_9 == -2
expect goals & 2
